---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_initPublish: initializePublishSaleResults() by Legion
    q_initPublish --> q_guard1: onlyLegion, whenNotPaused, whenCancelNotLocked, whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard1 --> q_lockCancel: s_cancelLocked = true
    q_lockCancel --> q_emitInit: emit PublishSaleResultsInitialized()
    q_emitInit --> q_publishStep: publishSaleResults() by Legion

    q_publishStep --> q_guard2: onlyLegion, whenNotPaused, whenCancelLocked, whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard2 --> q_verifyKey: _verifyValidPrivateKey(sealedBidPrivateKey)
    q_verifyKey --> q_setRoots: set claimMerkleRoot, acceptedMerkleRoot
    q_setRoots --> q_setCapital: s_capitalRaised = capitalRaised
    q_setCapital --> q_setKey: s_privateKey = sealedBidPrivateKey
    q_setKey --> q_emit: emit SaleResultsPublished(...)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_lockCancel
        INV-001: Two-step publish - first lock cancel, then publish results
        INV-002: Cancel locked prevents project from canceling during result publication
    end note

    note right of q_verifyKey
        INV-003: Private key must correspond to the ECIES public key set at initialization
        INV-004: After key reveal, all bids become decryptable via decryptSealedBid()
    end note
